Adventurer Guild Entrance [exits: west, south, southeast, northeast, north, southwest and east]
 This large room is the Adventurers guild. Truly breathtaking in its architecture, the guild houses a vast amount of
help for the new adventurers and the old. Its high domed ceiling swirls with blue and whites, like the sky on a very
windy day. Because it is domed and there are windows all along the wall, the room seems very open and very friendly.

2 Formula: Head: Lesser Wisdoms lie here, abandoned.

